<blockquote class="bigquote">
<p>
Grant me, O Lord my God,<br>
a mind to know you,<br>
a heart to seek you,<br>
conduct pleasing to you,<br>
faithful perseverance in waiting for you,<br>
and a hope of finally embracing you.
</p>
</blockquote>

<p class="bigquote">
St. Thomas Aquinas
</p>


